# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Entries dropped in the 1.21.11 -> 26.1.2 port (API removed, not renamed).
# The modules that relied on them need a rewrite, not a remap:
#
#   PlayerInteractEntityC2SPacket$Interact{,Type,At}Handler, #type, #ATTACK,
#   #write(PacketByteBuf)
#       26.1.2 ServerboundInteractPacket is a record
#       (int entityId, InteractionHand hand, Vec3 location, boolean usingSecondaryAction)
#       serialised through a public STREAM_CODEC. The handler hierarchy is gone and
#       attacking moved to the new net/minecraft/network/protocol/game/ServerboundAttackPacket.
#       Every member is already public, so no tweak is required.
#
#   GameRenderer#guiState (Lnet/minecraft/client/gui/render/state/GuiRenderState;)
#       GuiRenderState moved to net/minecraft/client/renderer/state/gui/GuiRenderState and
#       is owned by GameRenderer#guiRenderer (widened above).
#
#   GameRenderer#getFov(Camera, float, boolean)
#       removed; the field of view now lives on net/minecraft/client/renderer/Projection#fov()
#       (public) and CameraRenderState#hudFov (public).
#
#   DrawContext#tooltipDrawer
#       net/minecraft/client/gui/DrawContext (GuiGraphics) no longer exists; GUI drawing goes
#       through net/minecraft/client/gui/render/GuiRenderer + the GuiRenderState render graph.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
